{"id":"7e5037e9827d48cf","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/098_Heyting_算术_HA.md","title":"098 Heyting 算术 HA","display":"098_Heyting_算术_HA","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-直觉主义算术语言\">1. 直觉主义算术语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\subseteq Var:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\subseteq Var:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var,zero,succ,add,mul\">\\(var,zero,succ,add,mul\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp,\\quad all,\\quad ex.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp,\\quad all,\\quad ex.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var\">\\(fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var\\)</span> 对有限变量集取最小未用变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_{HA}\">\\(Tm_{HA}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"zero\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(zero\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(t\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"succ(t)\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(succ(t)\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"add(s,t)\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(add(s,t)\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(mul(s,t)\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{HA}\">\\(Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(bot\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ex(x,A)\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(ex(x,A)\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>否定不是新的原始构造子；以下</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)=imp(A,bot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)=imp(A,bot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>作为显示缩写使用。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换、alpha\">3. 自由变量、替换、alpha</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T^{HA}:Tm_{HA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{HA}:Frm_{HA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T^{HA}:Tm_{HA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{HA}:Frm_{HA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本文件中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T\">\\(FV_T\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T^{HA}\">\\(FV_T^{HA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV\">\\(FV\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F^{HA}\">\\(FV_F^{HA}\\)</span>。自由变量函数满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\quad FV(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\quad FV(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(and(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\n\\quad FV(or(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(and(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\n\\quad FV(or(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(imp(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(imp(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(all(x,A))=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad FV(ex(x,A))=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(all(x,A))=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad FV(ex(x,A))=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{HA}:Frm_{HA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{HA}:Frm_{HA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{HA}(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad BV_F^{HA}(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{HA}(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad BV_F^{HA}(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{HA}(and(A,B))=BV_F^{HA}(or(A,B))=BV_F^{HA}(imp(A,B))\n=BV_F^{HA}(A)\\cup BV_F^{HA}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{HA}(and(A,B))=BV_F^{HA}(or(A,B))=BV_F^{HA}(imp(A,B))\n=BV_F^{HA}(A)\\cup BV_F^{HA}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{HA}(all(x,A))=BV_F^{HA}(ex(x,A))=BV_F^{HA}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{HA}(all(x,A))=BV_F^{HA}(ex(x,A))=BV_F^{HA}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad mul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad mul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad bot[x:=s]=bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad bot[x:=s]=bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)[x:=s]=and(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[and(A,B)[x:=s]=and(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)[x:=s]=or(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[or(A,B)[x:=s]=or(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(y,A)\">\\(q(y,A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{all,ex\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{all,ex\\}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nq(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nq(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nq(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nq(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nq(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nq(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=fresh(FV(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{HA}:Tm_{HA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{HA}\\to Tm_{HA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{HA}:Tm_{HA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{HA}\\to Tm_{HA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{HA}:Frm_{HA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{HA}\\to Frm_{HA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^{HA}:Frm_{HA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{HA}\\to Frm_{HA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]=Sub_T^{HA}(t,x,s)\">\\(t[x:=s]=Sub_T^{HA}(t,x,s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]=Sub_F^{HA}(A,x,s)\">\\(A[x:=s]=Sub_F^{HA}(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA}\\subseteq Frm_{HA}\\times Frm_{HA}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA}\\subseteq Frm_{HA}\\times Frm_{HA}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{HA}\">\\(Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{HA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(eq(s,t),eq(s,t))\\in E\">\\((eq(s,t),eq(s,t))\\in E\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(bot,bot)\\in E\">\\((bot,bot)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(and(A_0,A_1),and(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((and(A_0,A_1),and(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(or(A_0,A_1),or(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((or(A_0,A_1),or(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{all,ex\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{all,ex\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q(x,A),q(x,B))\\in E\">\\((q(x,A),q(x,B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{all,ex\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{all,ex\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in Var\">\\(x,y\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(q(x,A),q(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(q(x,A),q(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-Heyting-逻辑公理\">4. Heyting 逻辑公理</h1>\n<p>直觉主义逻辑公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{IPC}^{HA}\">\\(Ax_{IPC}^{HA}\\)</span> 是下列七个集合的并；它们依次记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^{HA},Ax_{\\to2}^{HA},Ax_{\\wedge E}^{HA},Ax_{\\wedge I}^{HA},Ax_{\\vee I}^{HA},Ax_{\\vee E}^{HA},Ax_{\\bot}^{HA}\">\\(Ax_{\\to1}^{HA},Ax_{\\to2}^{HA},Ax_{\\wedge E}^{HA},Ax_{\\wedge I}^{HA},Ax_{\\vee I}^{HA},Ax_{\\vee E}^{HA},Ax_{\\bot}^{HA}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(and(A,B),A),\\ imp(and(A,B),B):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(and(A,B),A),\\ imp(and(A,B),B):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(A,imp(B,and(A,B))):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(A,imp(B,and(A,B))):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(A,or(A,B)),\\ imp(B,or(A,B)):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(A,or(A,B)),\\ imp(B,or(A,B)):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(imp(A,C),imp(imp(B,C),imp(or(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(imp(A,C),imp(imp(B,C),imp(or(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(bot,A):A\\in Frm_{HA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(bot,A):A\\in Frm_{HA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{IPC}^{HA}=Ax_{\\to1}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{HA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\wedge E}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\wedge I}^{HA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\vee I}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\vee E}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\bot}^{HA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{IPC}^{HA}=Ax_{\\to1}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{HA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\wedge E}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\wedge I}^{HA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\vee I}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\vee E}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\bot}^{HA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-量词与等词公理\">5. 量词与等词公理</h1>\n<p>量词公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^{HA}=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{HA},t\\in Tm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^{HA}=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{HA},t\\in Tm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^{HA}=\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_{HA},x\\notin FV(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^{HA}=\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_{HA},x\\notin FV(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\exists1}^{HA}=\\{imp(A[x:=t],ex(x,A)):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{HA},t\\in Tm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\exists1}^{HA}=\\{imp(A[x:=t],ex(x,A)):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{HA},t\\in Tm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\exists2}^{HA}=\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(ex(x,A),B)):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_{HA},x\\notin FV(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\exists2}^{HA}=\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(ex(x,A),B)):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_{HA},x\\notin FV(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_=^{HA}\n=\n\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_{HA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{HA},t,u\\in Tm_{HA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_=^{HA}\n=\n\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_{HA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{HA},t,u\\in Tm_{HA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-算术与归纳公理\">6. 算术与归纳公理</h1>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_0\">\\(x=v_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=v_1\\in Var\">\\(y=v_1\\in Var\\)</span>，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne y\">\\(x\\ne y\\)</span>；以下有限集合采用这两个互异变量。</p>\n<p>基本算术公理集合定义为下列六个闭公式组成的有限集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nAx_{HA}^{basic}=\\{\\;&amp;\nall(x,neg(eq(succ(var(x)),zero))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,imp(eq(succ(var(x)),succ(var(y))),eq(var(x),var(y))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(add(var(x),zero),var(x))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(add(var(x),succ(var(y))),succ(add(var(x),var(y)))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(mul(var(x),zero),zero)),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(mul(var(x),succ(var(y))),add(mul(var(x),var(y)),var(x)))))\n\\;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nAx_{HA}^{basic}=\\{\\;&amp;\nall(x,neg(eq(succ(var(x)),zero))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,imp(eq(succ(var(x)),succ(var(y))),eq(var(x),var(y))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(add(var(x),zero),var(x))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(add(var(x),succ(var(y))),succ(add(var(x),var(y)))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(mul(var(x),zero),zero)),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(mul(var(x),succ(var(y))),add(mul(var(x),var(y)),var(x)))))\n\\;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>归纳公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{HA}^{ind}\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=zero],imp(all(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),all(x,A))):A\\in Frm_{HA},x\\in Var\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{HA}^{ind}\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=zero],imp(all(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),all(x,A))):A\\in Frm_{HA},x\\in Var\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全体公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{HA}=Ax_{IPC}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\exists1}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\exists2}^{HA}\\cup Ax_=^{HA}\\cup Ax_{HA}^{basic}\\cup Ax_{HA}^{ind}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{HA}=Ax_{IPC}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\exists1}^{HA}\\cup Ax_{\\exists2}^{HA}\\cup Ax_=^{HA}\\cup Ax_{HA}^{basic}\\cup Ax_{HA}^{ind}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>HA 的目标差异由直觉主义公理族和全公式归纳族给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{IPC}^{HA}\\subseteq Ax_{HA},\n\\qquad\nAx_{HA}^{ind}\\subseteq Ax_{HA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{IPC}^{HA}\\subseteq Ax_{HA},\n\\qquad\nAx_{HA}^{ind}\\subseteq Ax_{HA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且没有把经典反证公理族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{HA}\">\\(Ax_{HA}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-规则与证明\">7. 规则与证明</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^{HA}=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^{HA}=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_{HA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^{HA}=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_{HA},x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\forall^{HA}=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_{HA},x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^{HA}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_{HA},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^{HA}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_{HA},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{HA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 出发的 HA 证明是非空有限公式序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\((A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in Ax_{HA}\">\\(A_i\\in Ax_{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^{HA}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=all(x,A_j)\">\\(A_i=all(x,A_j)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV(B)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^{HA}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^{HA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Proof_{HA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Proof_{HA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{HA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{HA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是上一节意义下的非空有限 HA 证明，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。归纳公理行必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{HA}^{ind}\">\\(Ax_{HA}^{ind}\\)</span> 中由某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in Frm_{HA}\">\\(B\\in Frm_{HA}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 生成的实例，量词规则行必须满足第 7 节的本地规则关系和假设自由变量条件。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{HA}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{HA}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Proof_{HA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(Proof_{HA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{HA}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_{HA},\nFrm_{HA},\nFV_T^{HA},\nFV_F^{HA},\nBV_F^{HA},\nfresh,\nSub_T^{HA},\nSub_F^{HA},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA},\nAx_{IPC}^{HA},\nAx_=^{HA},\nAx_{HA}^{basic},\nAx_{HA}^{ind},\nAx_{HA},\nRule_\\to^{HA},\nRule_\\forall^{HA},\nRule_\\alpha^{HA},\nProof_{HA},\n\\vdash_{HA}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{HA}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_{HA},\nFrm_{HA},\nFV_T^{HA},\nFV_F^{HA},\nBV_F^{HA},\nfresh,\nSub_T^{HA},\nSub_F^{HA},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{HA},\nAx_{IPC}^{HA},\nAx_=^{HA},\nAx_{HA}^{basic},\nAx_{HA}^{ind},\nAx_{HA},\nRule_\\to^{HA},\nRule_\\forall^{HA},\nRule_\\alpha^{HA},\nProof_{HA},\n\\vdash_{HA}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 Heyting 逻辑公理、算术基本公理、直觉主义归纳公理和 Hilbert 证明；不含语义载体、赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承、经典反证公理、经典命题公理或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-直觉主义算术语言","text":"1. 直觉主义算术语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换、alpha","text":"3. 自由变量、替换、alpha","level":1},{"id":"4.-Heyting-逻辑公理","text":"4. Heyting 逻辑公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-量词与等词公理","text":"5. 量词与等词公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-算术与归纳公理","text":"6. 算术与归纳公理","level":1},{"id":"7.-规则与证明","text":"7. 规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\subseteq Var:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i<n\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"var,zero,succ,add,mul","display":false},{"tex":"eq,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp,\\quad all,\\quad ex.","display":true},{"tex":"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var","display":false},{"tex":"Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"zero\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"succ(t)\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"add(s,t)\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_{HA}","display":false},{"tex":"bot\\in Frm_{HA}","display":false},